      },
      {
        "speakerId": "c-01",
        "topic": null,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 30788,
            "end": 61575,
            "text": "Good to see you again, thanks for making room for this."
          },
          {
            "start": 61576,
            "end": 86205,
            "text": "Hi, glad we could find a slot this week."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speakerId": "2002",
        "topic": null,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 92363,
            "end": 110835,
            "text": "Let me know what is top of mind and we will work through it."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speakerId": "c-01",
        "topic": null,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 123150,
            "end": 153938,
            "text": "It has been a fairly normal month for us, a couple of things came up though."
          },
          {
            "start": 153939,
            "end": 166253,
            "text": "We put together a short list of items for today's call."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speakerId": "2002",
        "topic": null,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 178568,
            "end": 221671,
            "text": "Sounds good, I have some time blocked so we can cover everything."
          },
          {
            "start": 221672,
            "end": 246301,
            "text": "That works, I will follow along and flag anything I need to check on."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speakerId": "c-01",
        "topic": null,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 252458,
            "end": 270931,
            "text": "When someone changes roles in our identity provider the sync misses it, and they keep the old permission set until someone catches it manually."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speakerId": "c-01",
        "topic": null,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 289403,
            "end": 307876,
            "text": "Two staff members changed departments back in August and still had their old access as of last week when someone noticed."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speakerId": "2002",
        "topic": null,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 326348,
            "end": 375609,
            "text": "Appreciate you walking through that, quick question on my end."
          },
          {
            "start": 375610,
            "end": 387924,
            "text": "How long did it take before anyone noticed the access had not updated?"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speakerId": "c-01",
        "topic": null,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 406396,
            "end": 443341,
            "text": "It was almost three weeks before someone flagged it."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speakerId": "2002",
        "topic": null,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 461814,
            "end": 492601,
            "text": "Thanks for that, let's talk about something else for a minute, how has the rest of the season been?"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speakerId": "c-01",
        "topic": null,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 498759,
            "end": 535704,
            "text": "We had our first snow of the season a few days ago."
